{
  "body": "<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">skip to content</a>\n<header class=\"site-header\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"Kiln home\"><img src=\"/assets/kiln-lockup-semibold-ink.svg\" alt=\"kiln\" width=\"104\" height=\"35\"></a><nav class=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Main\"><a href=\"/#local\">KilnOS</a><a href=\"/#hardware\">hardware</a><a href=\"/about\">about</a><button class=\"nav-contact enquiry-open\">contact</button></nav><button class=\"header-cta register-open\" data-interest=\"Kiln One\">register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><button class=\"menu-toggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><span class=\"menu-square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></header>\n<nav class=\"mobile-menu\" id=\"mobile-menu\" aria-label=\"Main menu\" hidden><div class=\"menu-links\"><a href=\"/#local\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>KilnOS<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span></a><a href=\"/#hardware\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>hardware<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</span></a><a href=\"/about\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>about<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</span></a><button class=\"menu-contact enquiry-open\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>contact<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">04</span></button></div><div class=\"menu-bottom\"><button class=\"action primary register-open\">register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/hardware\">explore the hardware <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></nav>\n<main id=\"main\"><section class=\"section product-page-hero one-finish-hero\" aria-labelledby=\"product-page-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><a class=\"meta\" href=\"/hardware\">← all hardware</a><span class=\"meta\">Private AI. Local compute.</span></div><div class=\"product-page-intro\"><p class=\"lead\">Your models.<br>Your machine.</p><p>A compact workstation for local AI. Start with one GPU and add a second as your workload grows.</p></div><div class=\"product-page-stage\"><h1 id=\"product-page-title\">One.</h1><img src=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/charcoal-960.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/charcoal-960.webp 960w, /assets/kiln/finishes/charcoal-3840.webp 3840w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 92vw, 54vw\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\" alt=\"Deep charcoal Kiln One with a finely textured shell, a soft brown leather handle and a USB-C upgrade port\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></div><div class=\"product-page-bottom\"><div><p class=\"product-price\">From £19,900</p><p class=\"meta\">1 GPU / ex VAT</p></div><button class=\"action primary register-open\" data-interest=\"Kiln One\">register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"kilnos\" aria-labelledby=\"kilnos-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">KilnOS</span><span class=\"meta\">AI-native operating system / in development</span></div><div class=\"section-intro\"><h2 id=\"kilnos-title\">A workspace<br>for making.</h2><p>KilnOS is being built to bring an agent, your project files and connected creative tools to One. Describe what you want to make, then shape the result.</p></div></section><section class=\"finish-runway product-finishes\" id=\"one-finishes\" data-finish-gallery aria-labelledby=\"finishes-title\"><div class=\"finish-stage\"><h2 class=\"finish-title\" id=\"finishes-title\">Five finishes.</h2><!-- finish viewer --></div></section><section class=\"section specifications\" id=\"inside-one\" aria-labelledby=\"inside-one-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2 id=\"inside-one-title\">Inside Kiln.</h2><span class=\"meta\">engineering targets / in development</span></div><div class=\"one-hardware-views\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/kiln/one-rear-io.webp\" aria-label=\"View the rear panel at full size\"><img src=\"/assets/kiln/one-rear-io.webp\" width=\"1402\" height=\"1122\" alt=\"Rear view of the charcoal Kiln One showing its USB, Ethernet, display and power connections.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption><h3 id=\"back\">Massive Connectivity For Ambitious Studios</h3><p>8 HDMI displays via DisplayPort adapters<br>3 USB-C (Thunderbolt 5) · 4 USB-A<br>2 × 10 GbE (RJ45) · 2 × 400 GbE (QSFP112)<br>2.2 kW power supply</p></figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/kiln/one-dual-blackwell.webp\" aria-label=\"View the two-GPU interior at full size\"><img src=\"/assets/kiln/one-dual-blackwell.webp\" width=\"1402\" height=\"1122\" alt=\"Kiln One with its side panel removed, showing two NVIDIA RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell Workstation Edition cards.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption><h3>Keep it brief</h3><p>Two-GPU Interior<br>Native OS parallelism for superfast local generation. No Wi-Fi involved.</p></figcaption></figure></div><dl class=\"spec-grid\"><div><dt>Graphics target</dt><dd>NVIDIA RTX PRO 6000</dd></div><div><dt>GPU memory</dt><dd>96 GB per GPU</dd></div><div><dt>GPU capacity</dt><dd>1 GPU, expandable to 2</dd></div><div><dt>System memory</dt><dd>128 GB</dd></div><div><dt>Storage</dt><dd>4 TB</dd></div><div><dt>Dimensions target</dt><dd>250 × 450 × 460 mm</dd></div></dl><p class=\"fine\">Targets are subject to validation. GPU memory is per card; pooling requires compatible software. Rendered components are illustrative.</p></section><section class=\"section\" aria-labelledby=\"configurations-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2 id=\"configurations-title\">Choose your capacity.</h2><span class=\"meta\">proposed hardware prices / ex VAT</span></div><div class=\"local-grid\"><article><span class=\"meta\">01 / one GPU</span><h3>£19,900</h3><p>One RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell with 96 GB GPU memory for local creative workflows.</p></article><article><span class=\"meta\">02 / two GPUs</span><h3>£31,900</h3><p>Two 96 GB GPUs give compatible workflows room for more parallel jobs. Add the second GPU for £12,000 when ordering.</p></article><article><span class=\"meta\">03 / both configurations</span><h3>Ready for<br>your projects.</h3><p>128 GB system memory and 4 TB storage in either configuration. Later GPU upgrades include quoted installation and logistics.</p></article></div><p class=\"fine\">Hardware is in development. Extra GPUs do not guarantee twice the speed or twice the active users.</p></section><section class=\"section local software-pricing\" id=\"software-pricing\" aria-labelledby=\"software-pricing-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">managed KilnOS</span><span class=\"meta\">proposed software plan</span></div><div class=\"section-intro\"><h2 id=\"software-pricing-title\">£99 per creator.<br>Per month.</h2><p>10-creator minimum. <strong>£11,880 per year minimum</strong>, billed annually, ex VAT. Shared projects, approvals, qualified updates and standard support.</p></div><p class=\"service-boundary\">Review-only seats are free. Creation and agent actions require a paid creator seat. Hardware, cloud usage, custom integrations and enhanced service levels are additional. Licensed seat counts do not guarantee simultaneous workload capacity.</p><p class=\"fine\">GPU upgrades leave your per-creator rate unchanged. Additional creator seats use the same rate.</p><p class=\"fine\">One with one GPU and the 10-creator software minimum targets £31,780 in year one, ex VAT, before additional services and operating costs.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"text-link enquiry-open\" data-interest=\"Kiln One\">discuss this plan <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></section><section class=\"section reservation\" id=\"interest\"><div class=\"reservation-heading\"><span class=\"meta\">Kiln One</span><h2>Be first.<br><span>To know.</span></h2><p>Product updates, straight to your inbox.</p></div><div class=\"reservation-card\"><button class=\"action primary register-open\" data-interest=\"Kiln One\">register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><p class=\"form-note\"><a href=\"/privacy\">privacy details</a></p></div></section></main>\n<footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"footer-main\"><a href=\"/#top\" aria-label=\"Kiln home\"><img src=\"/assets/kiln-lockup-semibold-paper.svg\" width=\"135\" height=\"46\" alt=\"kiln\"></a><p>Independent thinking.<br>Local compute.</p><nav aria-label=\"Footer\"><a href=\"/about\">about Kiln</a><a href=\"/#hardware\">the hardware</a><a href=\"/#questions\">questions</a><a href=\"/#privacy\">our privacy direction</a><a href=\"/privacy\">website privacy</a><button class=\"footer-contact enquiry-open\">contact us ↗</button></nav></div><div class=\"footer-bottom\"><span>© Kiln 2026 / Porto Labs</span><span>Hardware and software in development.</span><a href=\"/#top\">back to top ↑</a></div></footer>\n<button class=\"mobile-dock register-open\" data-interest=\"Kiln One\">register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button>\n<dialog id=\"register-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"register-title\"><button class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close registration\">×</button><h2 id=\"register-title\">Keep in<br>touch.</h2><p>Product news and launch updates.</p><form action=\"https://formspree.io/f/xjgepgbg\" method=\"POST\" class=\"enquiry-form\" data-enquiry-kind=\"interest\"><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"register-email\">email</label><input id=\"register-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" maxlength=\"254\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@studio.com\" required></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"register-product\">interested in <span>(optional)</span></label><select id=\"register-product\" name=\"product\"><option>Still exploring</option><option>Kiln One</option><option>Media</option><option>Legal</option><option>Investor interest</option></select></div><label class=\"consent\"><i