 class=\"form-note\">Just a reply. No mailing list. <a href=\"/privacy\">privacy</a></p></form><div class=\"form-status\" role=\"status\" hidden><h3>Message received.</h3><p>The Kiln team will follow up by email.</p><button class=\"text-link dialog-done\">back to Kiln <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div><div class=\"contact-booking\"><span>Prefer a conversation?</span><a href=\"/book/\">book a call <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></dialog>\n<dialog id=\"compare-dialog\" class=\"compare-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"compare-title\"><button class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close comparison\">×</button><span class=\"meta\">hardware / compare</span><h2 id=\"compare-title\">Find your fit.</h2><p>Proposed configurations. In development.</p><div class=\"compare-grid\"><article class=\"compare-item\"><h3>Kiln One</h3><strong>From £19,900</strong><p class=\"fine\">1 GPU / ex VAT</p><dl><dt>Graphics</dt><dd>RTX PRO 6000 / 96 GB per GPU</dd><dt>GPU capacity</dt><dd>1 GPU, expandable up to 2</dd><dt>Two-GPU configuration</dt><dd>£31,900 ex VAT</dd><dt>Upgrade when ordering</dt><dd>+£12,000 for a second GPU</dd><dt>System memory / Storage</dt><dd>128 GB / 4 TB</dd><dt>Dimensions / W × H × D</dt><dd>250 × 450 × 460 mm</dd></dl></article></div><p class=\"fine\">All figures are engineering targets, subject to validation. GPU memory is per card; multiple cards do not automatically form one memory pool. Renders show hardware concepts.</p><button class=\"text-link dialog-done\">back to the hardware <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></dialog>\n",
